.SH NAME 
.PP
miructl \- Control utility for \fImiru\-daemon\fR(1)
.PP
.SH USAGE 
.PP
\fImiructl\fR provides 2 commands:
.PD 0
.IP \(bu 4
\fItoggle\fR : Toggles the zoom overlay
.IP \(bu 4
\fIquit\fR : Quits \fImiru\-daemon\fR
.PD
.PP
.PP
.SH Setting up a keybind
.PP
\fImiructl\fR can be used in  a compositor\-level keybind (Niri, Hyprland, MangoWM etc) and pressing that keybind should run \fImiructl toggle\fR.\&
.PP
See:
https://codeberg.\&org/Vaishnav\-Sabari\-Girish/miru#setting\-up\-a\-keybind
.PP
